Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:57:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] LWE/Efficient: reuse Randomized.onesW instead of a local
 copy

The unary ones transducer already exists as Randomized.onesW
(Complexity/Randomized/BiasedCoinHalting.lean:448) with its reader length_onesW
and polyTimeComputable_onesW_snd; onesCount now reads it through them, and the
count of ones of List.ofFn g is the glue lemma count_true_ofFn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTmDD9txtmcmydGy4q5
